    "message": "This package is currently in development and not officially released.\nUPDATE: Fixed critical bug in 'StatBar' class that make the text inside the bar glitch out whenever the value was changed. This bug results in a crash when the text inside the bar becomes too large for the bar to handle. No idea which version introduced this bug so all versions have been deprecated with \"Critical Bugs\" just to be safe.",
